          "text": "Lino amupangike myoyo yanu amiyeeyo yanu kukuyandaula Jehova Leza wanu, Amunyamuke, muyake cikombelo cisalala ca-Jehova Leza wanu, kuti ibbokesi lyacizuminano ca-Jehova azibelesyo zisalala zya-Leza zinjizigwe muŋanda iiyakilidwe izina lya-Jehova.",
